  "known_limitations": [
    "Fixed centre-box prompt does not follow the object. By f_0020 the tissue box has been lifted out of the centre region, so SAM2 segments the wooden table under the prompt instead of the box (median_mask_hue_deg ~30 deg, violet_recall ~0). Single-image SAM2 has no temporal memory; downstream L2 should use the SAM2 video predictor (propagate_in_video) for tracking across frames. This does NOT affect the MPS-vs-CPU parity criterion, which holds on every frame because both devices make the same mistake.",
